From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:31:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 205/210] codecs: Add AVS1/AVS+ stateless decoder base class

Add GstAvsDecoder, a base class for stateless AVS1 (GB/T 20090.2) and
AVS+ (GY/T 257.1) decoders, with GstAvsPicture.

It takes one coded picture per buffer, as avsparse outputs them, and
gives the subclass the picture from its start code to the end of its
last slice with the offset of the first slice, and the last three I or
P pictures R0, R1 and R2: I and P pictures refer to R0 and R1, B
pictures to R1 and R0, and B pictures of field coded streams use the
picture distance of R2. P and B pictures whose references are missing
(stream start, open GOP) are dropped. Pictures are output in display
order: B pictures as soon as they are decoded, I and P pictures when
the next I or P picture is decoded, or at once in low delay sequences.

Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
